  m_Name: Vlad
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Vladislov
  LastName: Syrnikov
  Nickname: Mafia Boss
  Occupation: Businessman
  CharacterDescription: "An enormous, intimidating man who exudes confidence. He maintains unwavering, aggressive eye contact and speaks with the smooth, dangerous authority of someone who owns the city\u2014and everyone in it."
  CharacterArc: His arc is about predatory control; he treats the checkpoint like a minor inconvenience, subtly threatening the player while implying that the law is just a suggestion for a man of his stature.
  DateOfBirth: 15/05/1955
  Sex: Male
